   "t0": 5.65,
   "t1": 8.635
  },
  {
   "text": "Skully and Sparkplug are in the shop.",
   "t0": 8.945,
   "t1": 10.565
  },
  {
   "text": "Both from Chapter 1, Season 7.",
   "t0": 10.675,
   "t1": 12.475
  },
  {
   "text": "And eleven skins are on their last day, six of them Epic.",
   "t0": 12.735,
   "t1": 15.235
  },
  {
   "text": "Buying anything today?",
   "t0": 15.56,
   "t1": 16.494
  },
  {
